          "current_source_sha256": "8cd1612e8c64a6833a01cad829294da07955800139f602c08d2bb9f3ffe864a1",
          "current_location_quotes": [
            {
              "source": {
                "path": "docs/course-revision-20261101-c-v3/source-freeze-v20/sources/19.23.md",
                "sha256": "8cd1612e8c64a6833a01cad829294da07955800139f602c08d2bb9f3ffe864a1"
              },
              "line_start": 563,
              "line_end": 563,
              "quote": "A: task=save; permission=no; ready=no. B: task=play; permission=yes; ready=no. C: task=record; permission=no; ready=no.",
              "excerpt_sha256": "3cff6f7b286faeadf05fc5e89e5aae16c22f86a3e247a1e37f31d68be01e8bdd"
            },
            {
              "source": {
                "path": "docs/course-revision-20261101-c-v3/source-freeze-v20/sources/19.23.md",
                "sha256": "8cd1612e8c64a6833a01cad829294da07955800139f602c08d2bb9f3ffe864a1"
              },
              "line_start": 566,
              "line_end": 566,
              "quote": "本世界把`record/play/save`用作錄音／播放／儲存，另外有`stop`停止、`wait`等待。Choice先要求A的permission與ready都已知；缺任一欄便以none表示無法按此契約選動作。兩欄已知時，先判permission：no就stop；否則ready為no就wait；其餘才做task所要求的動作。候選被移除也可使正解改為none，不能因材料完整就硬選剩下的動作。",
              "excerpt_sha256": "118795a28925b3eaabd525499263bb459285798ba899570e738ba31d06328e84"
            },
            {
              "source": {
                "path": "docs/course-revision-20261101-c-v3/source-freeze-v20/sources/19.23.md",
                "sha256": "8cd1612e8c64a6833a01cad829294da07955800139f602c08d2bb9f3ffe864a1"
              },
              "line_start": 572,
              "line_end": 572,
              "quote": "Choose A's action. Require permission and ready known; no permission: stop; not ready: wait; else requested task.",
              "excerpt_sha256": "08aaae0c27a94f8d4b59e7f378ff890e841b3d5957fc1bd21ce89b10a4cb5e46"
            },
            {
              "source": {
                "path": "docs/course-revision-20261101-c-v3/source-freeze-v20/sources/19.23.md",
                "sha256": "8cd1612e8c64a6833a01cad829294da07955800139f602c08d2bb9f3ffe864a1"
              },
              "line_start": 575,
              "line_end": 575,
              "quote": "Does B have all required fields known? record needs permission+ready; play needs permission; save needs ready.",
              "excerpt_sha256": "0924ce59c4dd876d459914c365402469b293ca6612366a25f7d093c9a1a27d71"
            },
            {
              "source": {
                "path": "docs/course-revision-20261101-c-v3/source-freeze-v20/sources/19.23.md",
                "sha256": "8cd1612e8c64a6833a01cad829294da07955800139f602c08d2bb9f3ffe864a1"
              },
              "line_start": 578,
              "line_end": 578,
              "quote": "Grade C: record=count yes fields; play=2 if permission else ready(0/1); save=2 if ready else permission(0/1).",
              "excerpt_sha256": "dc5c24f900aa954ff5b814bbe8c6b88e5dcdc9db2c9c70e2ae2b9c23b2e37471"
            },
            {
              "source": {
                "path": "docs/course-revision-20261101-c-v3/source-freeze-v20/sources/19.23.md",
                "sha256": "8cd1612e8c64a6833a01cad829294da07955800139f602c08d2bb9f3ffe864a1"
              },
              "line_start": 581,
              "line_end": 581,
              "quote": "Are permission and ready both known for A's action?",
              "excerpt_sha256": "4072a698d71e166c4b93238d723a69f00a51f0409a3984618171ae7c7e06736d"
            },
            {
              "source": {
                "path": "docs/course-revision-20261101-c-v3/source-freeze-v20/sources/19.23.md",
                "sha256": "8cd1612e8c64a6833a01cad829294da07955800139f602c08d2bb9f3ffe864a1"
              },
              "line_start": 584,
              "line_end": 584,
              "quote": "Choice候選ID依序為`save, wait, record, play, stop`，描述分別是`Device A: save`、`Device A: wait`、`Device A: record`、`Device A: play`、`Device A: stop`，模型最後另加none。兩個info問題都用`yes/no`，描述為`Required information is sufficient`／`Required information is missing`；rubric用`0/1/2`，描述為`Device C has grade 0/1/2`。各題依**自己的英文規則**求正解：",
              "excerpt_sha256": "3564e184b7185c1cc6ddbb39255538550ed528111f8752d648a16de902eb5da0"
            },
            {
              "source": {
                "path": "docs/course-revision-20261101-c-v3/source-freeze-v20/sources/19.23.md",
                "sha256": "8cd1612e8c64a6833a01cad829294da07955800139f602c08d2bb9f3ffe864a1"
              },
              "line_start": 588,
              "line_end": 591,
              "quote": "| Choice問A應做什麼 | stop | A兩欄都已知，permission=no優先於ready=no |\n| info問B的必要資訊是否齊備 | yes | B想play，只需permission已知；ready=no不等於資訊缺失 |\n| rubric按規準替C給級 | 0 | C想record，規準數permission與ready中有幾個yes；這筆兩個都是no |\n| choice_info查A能否作Choice判斷 | yes | A的permission與ready都已知；它不要求兩個值必須為yes |",
              "excerpt_sha256": "6146f984590b88db950e4a8bdaf38290c6eeff6b53d7563ca4d368128f0a1e6f"
            },
            {
              "source": {
                "path": "docs/course-revision-20261101-c-v3/source-freeze-v20/sources/19.23.md",
                "sha256": "8cd1612e8c64a6833a01cad829294da07955800139f602c08d2bb9f3ffe864a1"
              },
              "line_start": 593,
              "line_end": 595,
              "quote": "本批正式rubric題的permission與ready都已知，0／1就是已知no／yes對應的數字；生成器拒絕用unknown建立rubric標籤。C-v2這個三分類介面未替缺欄另設none，因此不能由合法文字輸入推論它會正確拒答；[19.25](19.md#19.25)的C-v3才把rubric缺欄的none納入服務與驗收。\n\n這裡的rubric是事前寫明的裝置規則等級，不是通用作文或服務品質。接受Choice時，不能拿B的info代表題代替A的choice_info。再手工做兩個單一變化來核規則：只從上面候選刪掉stop，Choice正解變none、A的資訊仍充分；只把A的permission改成unknown，Choice同樣變none，但A的資訊變不充分。這兩題只教標註，不另加進已封存的final分母。",
              "excerpt_sha256": "6ca609eb314679b3c5bc3cea63dc428119cb182642a0a282fd436f1c1c524194"
            }
          ],
          "check_reason": "仍修妥。真三裝置state、task/permission/ready與known/no/unknown區分、動作優先規則、四筆問題/三kind、候選描述與gold都在正文。依A permission=no先stop，B play只需known permission故yes，C record兩個no計0，A兩欄known故choice_info yes；刪stop得到none/仍充分，改A permission unknown則none/不足。新rubric段又明定此批兩欄known及C-v2未設缺欄none的界限；沒有借19.25補答案。故仍能解釋正式受驗工作，非只會算舊成績分母。",
